    {
      "id": "production-hotel-01-q1-question",
      "contentId": "production-hotel-01-q1",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "What could you say to let the front desk know you’re ready to start your stay?",
      "cacheKey": "3582c25883f850f6f24d2f266c9f8594d5cb3985ccb3aa21af550f26ec1d163b",
      "file": "audio/cache/3582c25883f850f6f24d2f266c9f8594d5cb3985ccb3aa21af550f26ec1d163b.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-hotel-01-q1-answer",
      "contentId": "production-hotel-01-q1",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "체크인하고 싶어요.",
      "cacheKey": "9717129477089ecbb94f72d8450cf45a511284321161883e1c7afb5b60b4abec",
      "file": "audio/cache/9717129477089ecbb94f72d8450cf45a511284321161883e1c7afb5b60b4abec.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-hotel-01-q1-explanation",
      "contentId": "production-hotel-01-q1",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "I'd like to check in. This is a polite way to tell someone what you want to do.",
      "cacheKey": "1da491a360acb43d0d9e5704d1ec3324d821877544b848b917bdef790b8dd3df",
      "file": "audio/cache/1da491a360acb43d0d9e5704d1ec3324d821877544b848b917bdef790b8dd3df.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-hotel-01-q2-question",
      "contentId": "production-hotel-01-q2",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "How would you politely ask for an extra towel?",
      "cacheKey": "d96a77d9602818d52165625b80b698b713c7e1e1be05f540b07f1f3b6caa583d",
      "file": "audio/cache/d96a77d9602818d52165625b80b698b713c7e1e1be05f540b07f1f3b6caa583d.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-hotel-01-q2-answer",
      "contentId": "production-hotel-01-q2",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "수건 하나 더 주세요.",
      "cacheKey": "d92ffd0adb938e1ef822a7b48e523033b9e788ee0ee047438e2275b6d4d93ea2",
      "file": "audio/cache/d92ffd0adb938e1ef822a7b48e523033b9e788ee0ee047438e2275b6d4d93ea2.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-hotel-01-q2-explanation",
      "contentId": "production-hotel-01-q2",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "One more towel, please. The phrase for “one more” specifies that you need an additional towel.",
      "cacheKey": "c7aeead22785bc6aaf82c418c88a6092edaf0003d4ceddc5ec868843ab543542",
      "file": "audio/cache/c7aeead22785bc6aaf82c418c88a6092edaf0003d4ceddc5ec868843ab543542.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-hotel-01-q3-question",
      "contentId": "production-hotel-01-q3",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "What would you ask when you need the password to get online?",
      "cacheKey": "f1291f79cbc69bb42fb2cea9040d917b7936eb11bc81ac8974896ac39d3b8f3b",
      "file": "audio/cache/f1291f79cbc69bb42fb2cea9040d917b7936eb11bc81ac8974896ac39d3b8f3b.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-hotel-01-q3-answer",
      "contentId": "production-hotel-01-q3",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "와이파이 비밀번호가 뭐예요?",
      "cacheKey": "ce28522e2324085e2ef8e531ba67275fa67d6ae580bde0bde909f6f915b576bf",
      "file": "audio/cache/ce28522e2324085e2ef8e531ba67275fa67d6ae580bde0bde909f6f915b576bf.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-hotel-01-q3-explanation",
      "contentId": "production-hotel-01-q3",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "What is the Wi-Fi password? This question asks for the password, rather than the network name.",
      "cacheKey": "19bd1e6216ffd69f36e6bcdb54a2c83fa701588d7c172259d1649bf7ab0507fa",
      "file": "audio/cache/19bd1e6216ffd69f36e6bcdb54a2c83fa701588d7c172259d1649bf7ab0507fa.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-hotel-01-q4-question",
      "contentId": "production-hotel-01-q4",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "How would you ask someone to point you to the elevator?",
      "cacheKey": "413e47558a72e99c56ee06642139de5f6d6e62d34fc37248e75beb08dcc607f1",
      "file": "audio/cache/413e47558a72e99c56ee06642139de5f6d6e62d34fc37248e75beb08dcc607f1.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-hotel-01-q4-answer",
      "contentId": "production-hotel-01-q4",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "엘리베이터가 어디예요?",
      "cacheKey": "1e3a3b2d410334cdee6111f02dcaa78784618de88a988a87b49248ca8d5c9c2b",
      "file": "audio/cache/1e3a3b2d410334cdee6111f02dcaa78784618de88a988a87b49248ca8d5c9c2b.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-hotel-01-q4-explanation",
      "contentId": "production-hotel-01-q4",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "Where is the elevator? The question ending turns a location phrase into a polite question.",
      "cacheKey": "52b52bc02546851a6640f935f3e17b2ee0da41246b8300ae3683dffcf7605ae3",
      "file": "audio/cache/52b52bc02546851a6640f935f3e17b2ee0da41246b8300ae3683dffcf7605ae3.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-hotel-01-q5-question",
      "contentId": "production-hotel-01-q5",
      "role": "question",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "What could you say to report the card problem and ask staff to check it?",
      "cacheKey": "d9c17b440d63744a8d90bc1aa77aa46b43ba94510cf6f5e9524c9b2fb95f1015",
      "file": "audio/cache/d9c17b440d63744a8d90bc1aa77aa46b43ba94510cf6f5e9524c9b2fb95f1015.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-hotel-01-q5-answer",
      "contentId": "production-hotel-01-q5",
      "role": "answer",
      "language": "ko-KR",
      "text": "카드키가 안 돼요. 확인해 주세요.",
      "cacheKey": "ccd3f80aec6971e41a87215c98a9a9166abd591867b5810f713c75900f3d7771",
      "file": "audio/cache/ccd3f80aec6971e41a87215c98a9a9166abd591867b5810f713c75900f3d7771.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
    {
      "id": "production-hotel-01-q5-explanation",
      "contentId": "production-hotel-01-q5",
      "role": "explanation",
      "language": "en-US",
      "text": "The key card doesn't work. Please check it. This combines a polite problem report with a request for help.",
      "cacheKey": "6956f362c4cc2baf0cddde93e211a6207d0a3014293e358e2d85e59e89a5fc2f",
      "file": "audio/cache/6956f362c4cc2baf0cddde93e211a6207d0a3014293e358e2d85e59e89a5fc2f.wav",
      "durationSeconds": null
    },
